{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50169","headline":"感春 · 胡皓","name":"感春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"试登高台春，伏槛弄阳旭。\n纡寂融密思，韶和洗纷瞩。\n林暖花意红，墀薰草情绿。\n感物深自负，萋萋杨□□。\n（〖1〗右三首，载於伯三七七一《珠英集》残卷的开端。\n原共五首，不着撰人。\n第四首《奉天田明府席饯别》第五首《答徐四萧关别醉後见投》与後重出。\n已据重出部份的题名载入胡皓诗内。\n因疑前三首亦胡皓所作，故附於此。\n即非胡皓所作，亦必爲其他《珠英》学士的作品。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡皓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50169.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50169","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}